# SDD: First vertical slice — W-1-TOKENS-BUTTON
status: specified
authority: migration-first-slice
date: 2026-09-08

## Why this slice

Tokens without a consumer cannot be verified. Button without tokens hardcodes color. Kernel already has `components.rs::button` and CSS vars — the slice **converges** that helper (and theme tokens) to cronus-ui contract instead of inventing a parallel widget.

## In

- Native semantic tokens aligned with `--cronus-*` for at least aurora+neutral × light+dark (full 5 themes preferred if values can be copied from `packages/tokens` without React).
- `data-cronus-theme` / `data-cronus-mode` on the document root.
- Button primitive:
  - variants: primary, secondary, outline, ghost, destructive, link
  - sizes: sm, md, lg, icon, icon-sm
  - href → link
  - default type button
  - disabled
  - `data-slot="button"` `data-variant`
  - focus-visible ring token
  - no uppercase requirement (source is not uppercase; current kernel helper is — **intentional change**)
- Parser/render path: a `.cronus` demo that produces the Button via kernel render (existing component invocation or section). **No new tokenizer keyword.**
- Tests: image snapshots per variant; forbidden palette scan on `components.rs` button path; theme var presence.
- Demo file under `demos/` or `templates/`.
- Evidence dir `migration/evidence/w-1/button/`.
- LANGUAGE.md: document Button+tokens as REAL only after tests.

## Out

- Input and rest of Wave 0
- Looks (brutalist/glass) — inventory only this slice
- Runtime override API completeness (minimal CSS var override in tests is enough)
- CLI theme command
- Keyboard overlay harness
- Pixel-perfect vs www gallery

## Characterization of source Button (`packages/ui/src/components/button.tsx`)

- CVA variants/sizes as above
- `asChild` via Slot
- `data-slot="button"` `data-variant`
- type default `button` unless asChild
- destructive: `bg-[color-mix(in_oklch,var(--cronus-error),black_30%)] text-white`
- link: `text-primary-strong`
- focus-visible ring 2 / ring-offset 2 / ring-offset-surface-base
- disabled opacity 50 pointer-events none
- active scale 0.98
- ease `var(--ease-out-quart)`

## Characterization of current kernel button (`src/components.rs::button`)

- variants primary/secondary/ghost/danger/outline — **rename danger→destructive, add link**
- sizes sm/md/lg — **add icon, icon-sm**
- CSS vars `--foreground` / `--background` / `--border` / `--danger` — **map or replace with `--cronus-*`**
- uppercase + tracking-wide — **drop to match source**
- no data-slot, no disabled, no type, no focus-visible ring
- `icon_button` uses amber/neutral palette — **out of slice except must not be used by the demo**

